    {"symbol": "⚛️", "tooltip": "Like Price-Anderson capped nuclear operator liability and layered a federal backstop above the unpriceable tail, the deployer pays a bounded share and the public catches what no tier could foresee."},
    {"symbol": "🚪", "tooltip": "The victim enters through one door for recovery, but behind it the apportionment splits — traced contribution for decomposable harm, duty-of-care plus backstop for the emergent residual."}
  ],
